HTTrack 3.50.5: a copy you stop leaves a clean mirror.

• A copy you stop no longer leaves unfinished files or empty folders behind
• A link that was never fetched still points at the web, not at a file that was never saved
• With a time limit set, a copy now ends on time instead of waiting for a stuck lookup
• Temporary files left by a failed write or by a copy that was killed are now removed